<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078818" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice> et toto Orbe Celeberrimo
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Ex <rs key="B_991170515018105501" type="letter">nuperrimis tuis litteris</rs> a. d. XVI <choice><abbr>Calend.</abbr><expan>Calendarum</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Decem<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>br.</abbr><expan>Decembris</expan></choice> datis intellexi ad Vos pervenisse <rs key="B_991170517051905501" type="letter">binas meas
      <lb/>epistolas</rs> simul cum <rs key="biblio_IMQW7IQZ" type="biblio">schedis</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatianis</rs>.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti bezieht sich auf Johanns <rs key="B_991170515018105501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 16. November 1715. Johann bestätigt darin den Empfang der erneut übersandten Riccati-Schrift und bemerkt, dass Michelotti sie zuvor bereits an Nicolaus I Bernoulli geschickt hatte. Vgl. Michelottis <rs key="B_991170517051905501" type="letter">Brief</rs> vom 8. August 1715.</note> Doctissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mi Agnati Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolai</rs> <rs key="B_991170517051505501" type="letter">litteras</rs> cum ultima
      <lb/>responsione ad <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Riccatum</rs> nondum accepi;
      <lb/>Statim ac ad me pervenerint, responsum vestr<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>italicam in linguam translatum <rs key="biblio_3RJU6R8K" type="biblio">Diario Veneto</rs>
      <lb/>inseri summa diligentia curabo.</p>
  <p>Gratias ago maximas pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> iis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> scribere ad
      <lb/>me <unclear>v</unclear>oluisti ad dissipandos nonnullos errores qui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>peditus mentem tuam non satis asse<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>qui poteram in <choice><abbr>eruditiss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr><expan>eruditissima</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Dissertat.</abbr><expan>Dissertatione</expan></choice> tua de motu
      <lb/>musculorum.</p>
  <p>De Mathematum <rs type="organisation">Cathedra</rs> acquirenda non<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dum desperatum est pro <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs> Tuo:
      <lb/>etenim fieri potest ut a novo <rs type="organisation">Magistra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078819" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>tu</rs> vocetur ad docendum uti ego quotidie
      <lb/>rogo pro bono <rs type="organisation">Archilycei Patavini</rs>.</p>
  <p>Pro <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filio</rs> Tuo Doctissimo, quem ais intelli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gere omnia scripta Vestra, meque posse adiu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vare in ipsis intelligendis, si patieris ut veniat
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetias</rs>, ipsum libenter tanquam meum Fili<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>suscipiam, eique Domi me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> cubiculum sine
      <lb/>expensis parabo, ac alimenta neccessaria
      <lb/>etiam sine sumptibus subministrabo
      <lb/>saltem si me adiuvare volet in
      <lb/>omnibus scriptis et inventis vestris intelli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gendis. Poteris igitur <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filium</rs> mittere quam<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>primum aut saltem ventura Quadragesima,
      <lb/>sciasque me ipsum magnopere fore ama<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>turum tanquam meum proprium filium. </p>
  <p>Interim Te aut <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">filium</rs> tuum Doctissimum rogo
      <lb/>ut hanc equationem mihi resolvatis <formula>10000a-a^{3}</formula>
      <lb/><formula>=3</formula>. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quatio resoluta dabit totam Tabellam
      <lb/>quam <rs key="pers_DE-588-118771167" type="person">Wallisius</rs> exhibuit in <choice><orig>oper.</orig><reg><abbr>Oper.</abbr><expan>Operum</expan></reg></choice> <choice><abbr>mathem.</abbr><expan>mathematicorum</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>volum.</abbr><expan>volumine</expan></choice>
<pb facs="1078820" n="3"/>
      <lb/>1<supplied>,</supplied> <choice><abbr>pag.</abbr><expan>pagina</expan></choice>  m 1059 pro inveniendis singulis subleva<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tionibus ponderis <formula>P</formula> ope vesic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> spiritu humano
      <lb/>inflat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>. Valorem ipsius a ex <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quatione data non<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dum potui recte elicere. In casu quo ha<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bemus <formula>10000a-a^{3}=3</formula> invenit <rs key="pers_DE-588-118771167" type="person">Wallisius</rs> <formula>a=</formula>
      <lb/><formula>NP=09.999,849,999,66</formula>.<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Vgl. John Wallis, <rs key="biblio_XWAR5J2N" type="biblio"><hi rend="i">Opera mathematica</hi></rs>, Bd. I (Oxford 1695), S. 1059, erste Zeile der Spalte A. Der Tabellenwert lautet im Druck «99.999,849,999,66». Michelotti schreibt an erster Stelle eine 0.</note> Peto ut modum inveniendi
      <lb/>hosce valores mihi indicetis.</p>
  <p>Cupio ut me admoneas de Adventu <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filii</rs>
      <lb/>Tui ut neccessaria pro ipso parare possim.
      <lb/>Spero quod <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> Tuus miserit suas
      <lb/>litteras per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs>; illa enim <choice><orig><g ref="#est">&#xE4E9;</g></orig><reg>est</reg></choice> via certa:
      <lb/>interim obstupesco quod ad me nondum pervenerint.</p>
  <p>Ego sum paratissimus ad omnia mandata
      <lb/>vestra, salutem plurimam mitto Clarissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mis Viris <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filio</rs> et Agnato Tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao</rs>.</p> <closer><salute>Vale
      <lb/>et fave.</salute> <dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <date when="1715-12-05">Nonis Decembris
      <lb/>MDCCXV</date></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1078821" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>
